Deposit Function – Mini Project
This small project demonstrates how a simple deposit function works in a basic banking system. 
The goal is to show how a user can add money to their account, with proper validation and balance updates.
This project was created as part of a programming exercise to practice:
- functions
- input validation
- UI design
Features
- Deposit money into an account
- Validate the deposit amount (must be positive)
- Update the account balance
- Show confirmation to the user
- Simple and easy to extend for future features (withdraw, transfer, etc.)
